    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neuroarena is a free-to-play online card game where players engage in thrilling PvP duels and explore a universe of unique, AI-generated cards. Every card evolves, offering endless strategic opportunities for CCG enthusiasts to create powerful, one-of-a-kind decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426240/extras/64f099d00ae8f40984dc2776dff5863d.avif?t=1754300782\" width=800 height=391 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GENERATE UNIQUE CARDS</strong><br>Harness the power of AI-generated cards, ensuring every card is completely unique. Modify and evolve your cards in real time to create hyper cards that adapt to your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUEL AND VOTE</strong><br>Challenge other players in PvP duels and vote on the best cards. Win votes to gain experience, unlock new modification slots, and push your cards to their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODIFY AND EVOLVE</strong><br>Add modifications to your cards, transforming their abilities and appearance. For example, apply a &quot;Fire&quot; modification to a Fox card to create a powerful Fire Fox. The more modifications you use, the stronger and more distinct your cards become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR COLLECTION</strong><br>Collect super-unique cards and art modifications to create a deck that\u2019s truly your own. No two decks are alike, making your collection a reflection of your creativity and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMPETE FOR GLORY</strong><br>Earn your place on the leaderboards by winning votes and duels. Invite friends to join the adventure and prove your mastery in this constantly evolving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of CCGs is here \u2013 start your journey today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426240/extras/355fe81bce521aa3d6cce19107a851a8.avif?t=1754300782\" width=800 height=391 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
